# Rule 1: values are passed by value or by const reference.  A parameter by
# lvalue reference to a non-const type, spelled directly or through an alias,
# lets a call change its argument: the mutation channel.  Function parameters
# only (not the locals of a requires-expression); lambdas are not a rule.
match parmVarDecl(hasType(hasCanonicalType(lValueReferenceType())), hasType(hasCanonicalType(references(qualType(unless(isConstQualified()))))), hasDeclContext(functionDecl(unless(cxxMethodDecl(ofClass(cxxRecordDecl(isLambda())))))), isExpansionInMainFile(), hasAncestor(scope))
